  "brief": { "zh": "带着两份化石拓印从西南营地撤离。琥珀拓印在北边，蕨叶拓印在东边。峡谷里一台追踪机会追着芽芽走，另两台巡逻机沿固定线路折返。相遇或迎面对穿都会被拦下。第 12 和 26 回合结束后有石桥升降。第 58 回合结束前回到营地。", "en": "Escape through the southwest camp with both fossil rubbings. The amber print lies to the north and the fern print to the east. One tracker follows Sprout while two patrols travel fixed routes through the canyon. Meeting a robot or swapping squares head-on ends the run. Stone bridges change after turns 12 and 26. Return to camp by turn 58." },
